<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>DevGames — Aprenda React com Projetos Reais</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,300;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,400&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  /* --- RESET & VARIÁVEIS --- */
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  :root {
    --bg:       #0a0b0d;
    --surface:  #121316;
    --surface2: #1c1e22;
    --border:   #2d3035;
    --text:     #f0f0f0;
    --muted:    #8b8e94;
    --accent:   #b6f542; /* Lime Dev */
    --accent2:  #42d9c8; /* Cyan */
    --warn:     #ffb84d;
    --danger:   #ff5c5c;
    --mono:     'DM Mono', monospace;
    --serif:    'Fraunces', serif;
    --sans:     'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    --radius:   12px;
  }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  /* --- NAVEGAÇÃO --- */
  nav {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(10, 11, 13, 0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    height: 64px;
  }
  .nav-logo {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }
  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; }
  .nav-links a {
    font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }

  /* --- HERO SECTION --- */
  .hero {
    max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px;
    gap: 3rem; align-items: center;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 3.8rem);
    font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .hero h1 em { font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; color: var(--accent2); }
  .hero-lead {
    font-size: 17px; color: var(--muted); max-width: 520px;
  }

  /* --- TILE ANIMATION --- */
  .hero-tiles {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 6px;
  }
  .tile {
    width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;
    border: 2px solid var(--border);
    animation: slideUp 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1) both;
  }
  .tile.c { background: #538d4e; border-color: #538d4e; color: #fff; }
  .tile.p { background: #b59f3b; border-color: #b59f3b; color: #fff; }

  @keyframes slideUp {
    0% { transform: translateY(20px); opacity: 0; }
    100% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
  }

  /* --- GAME SELECTOR --- */
  .section { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.5rem 5rem; }
  .section-label {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem; display: block;
  }
  .game-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  .game-card {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.5rem;
    cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-align: left; position: relative;
  }
  .game-card:hover { border-color: var(--muted); transform: translateY(-4px); }
  .game-card.active { border-color: var(--accent); background: #1a2010; }
  
  .game-icon { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .game-name { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .game-desc { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.4; }
  
  /* --- DIFFICULTY BADGES --- */
  .diff {
    display: inline-block; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px;
    padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 1rem; font-weight: 600;
  }
  .diff-easy  { background: rgba(126, 200, 122, 0.1); color: #7ec87a; }
  .diff-med   { background: rgba(245, 166, 35, 0.1); color: #f5a623; }
  .diff-hard  { background: rgba(245, 87, 66, 0.1); color: #f55742; }

  /* --- CONTENT BOXES & STEPS --- */
  .game-content { display: none; animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease; }
  .game-content.active { display: block; }

  @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }

  .step {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius); margin-bottom: 12px; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .step-header {
    padding: 1.25rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;
    cursor: pointer; user-select: none;
  }
  .step-num {
    width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 6px;
    display: grid; place-items: center; font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; background: var(--surface2);
  }
  .step-title { font-weight: 600; flex: 1; color: var(--text); }

  details .step-body {
    padding: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  /* --- CODE & TIPS --- */
  pre {
    background: #010101; padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 8px;
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; overflow-x: auto;
    margin: 1rem 0; border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .tip {
    background: #121a12; border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  .tip p { color: #a4d491 !important; margin: 0 !important; font-size: 13.5px !important; }

  /* --- RESPONSIVO --- */
  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; }
    .hero-lead { margin: 0 auto; }
    .hero-tiles { display: none; }
    .game-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <a class="nav-logo" href="#">{ dev.games }</a>
  <div class="nav-links">
    <a href="#termo">Termo</a>
    <a href="#contexto">Contexto</a>
    <a href="#conexo">Conexo</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
  <div>
    <p class="hero-eyebrow">Aprenda na prática</p>
    <h1>Crie clones de<br><em>jogos virais</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-lead">Explore a arquitetura do React através da lógica por trás de sucessos como Termo e Contexto.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-tiles">
    <div class="tile c" style="animation-delay: 0.1s">R</div>
    <div class="tile p" style="animation-delay: 0.2s">E</div>
    <div class="tile p" style="animation-delay: 0.3s">A</div>
    <div class="tile c" style="animation-delay: 0.4s">C</div>
    <div class="tile c" style="animation-delay: 0.5s">T</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <span class="section-label">Selecione o Projeto</span>

  <div class="game-grid">
    <div class="game-card active" id="card-termo" onclick="selectGame('termo')">
      <div class="game-icon">🟩</div>
      <div class="game-name">Termo</div>
      <div class="game-desc">Trabalhe com estados complexos de matrizes e inputs de teclado.</div>
      <span class="diff diff-easy">Iniciante</span>
    </div>
    <div class="game-card" id="card-contexto" onclick="selectGame('contexto')">
      <div class="game-icon">📍</div>
      <div class="game-name">Contexto</div>
      <div class="game-desc">Aprenda integração com APIs e algoritmos de similaridade.</div>
      <span class="diff diff-med">Intermediário</span>
    </div>
    <div class="game-card" id="card-conexo" onclick="selectGame('conexo')">
      <div class="game-icon">🔗</div>
      <div class="game-name">Conexo</div>
      <div class="game-desc">Domine o useReducer e máquinas de estado para UI.</div>
      <span class="diff diff-hard">Avançado</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="content-termo" class="game-content active">
    <div class="step">
      <details open>
        <summary class="step-header">
          <div class="step-num">01</div>
          <span class="step-title">Decomposição em Componentes</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="step-body">
          <p>Divida sua interface em pedaços lógicos. No Termo, o segredo é a <strong>Row (Linha)</strong>.</p>
          <div class="tip"><p><strong>Dica:</strong> Mantenha o componente de Tile "burro" (stateless), apenas recebendo a cor e a letra via props.</p></div>
          <pre><code>// Exemplo de estrutura
&lt;Grid&gt;
  {guesses.map(g => &lt;Row key={g.id} word={g} /&gt;)}
&lt;/Grid&gt;</code></pre>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
    </div>

  <div id="content-contexto" class="game-content">
    <div class="step">
      <details open>
        <summary class="step-header">
          <div class="step-num">01</div>
          <span class="step-title">Consumindo a API de Semântica</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="step-body">
          <p>O Contexto não valida letras, mas sim o significado. Use <code>fetch</code> para buscar o ranking da palavra.</p>
          <pre><code>const response = await fetch(`api.contexto.me/word/${input}`);</code></pre>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>

<script>
  function selectGame(gameId) {
    // 1. Atualizar classes dos cards
    document.querySelectorAll('.game-card').forEach(card => {
      card.classList.remove('active');
    });
    document.getElementById('card-' + gameId).classList.add('active');

    // 2. Trocar conteúdo visível
    document.querySelectorAll('.game-content').forEach(content => {
      content.classList.remove('active');
    });
    document.getElementById('content-' + gameId).classList.add('active');
  }
</script>

</body>
</html>
